import{_ as o,o as n,c as t,a2 as i}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 822 | Transcended Ones and the Cosmos | The Depersonified Understanding of Cosmic Will","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 822 | Transcended Ones and the Cosmos | The Depersonified Understanding of Cosmic Will","no":822,"module":4,"tags":["Transcended One","Cosmos","Cosmic Will","Depersonified","Law-First Axiom"],"related":["00-Heng Yuan Zhou Cosmos Overview","09-Reality-as-Base Fundamental Stance","21-Symbiotic-Network Operating Principles"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0822_模块4-超脱者与宇宙-宇宙意志非人格化理解.md","filePath":"en/0822_模块4-超脱者与宇宙-宇宙意志非人格化理解.md"}'),s={name:"en/0822_模块4-超脱者与宇宙-宇宙意志非人格化理解.md"};function a(r,e,l,d,h,c){return n(),t("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[i('<h1 id="entry-822-transcended-ones-and-the-cosmos-the-depersonified-understanding-of-cosmic-will" tabindex="-1">Entry 822 | Transcended Ones and the Cosmos | The Depersonified Understanding of Cosmic Will <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-822-transcended-ones-and-the-cosmos-the-depersonified-understanding-of-cosmic-will" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 822 | Transcended Ones and the Cosmos | The Depersonified Understanding of Cosmic Will&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 00, 09, 21</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-the-cosmos-has-no-personality-the-cosmos-only-has-laws" tabindex="-1">Introduction: the cosmos has no personality, the cosmos only has laws <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-the-cosmos-has-no-personality-the-cosmos-only-has-laws" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: the cosmos has no personality, the cosmos only has laws&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The old system&#39;s handling of &quot;cosmic will&quot; is very casual: the cosmos is a conscious being; it has preferences, emotions, intentions — it chooses protagonists, it sends calamities, it judges all beings. This personification treatment turns the cosmos into a super big shot — it is stronger than all strong ones because it is &quot;will itself.&quot; Heng Yuan Zhou completely negates this understanding. In the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s orthodox framework, <strong>cosmic will has no personified subject — the cosmos has no preference, no emotion, no private intention. It only has laws.</strong></p><p>Six top-level axioms in this entry centrally embody the law-first axiom: the cosmos&#39; operation is not &quot;some will&#39;s arrangement,&quot; but &quot;the law network&#39;s natural running.&quot; The anti-predation axiom requires demoting the cosmos from &quot;personified sovereign&quot; to &quot;depersonified law system&quot; — this way no one may impersonate &quot;cosmic will&quot; to predate; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires cosmic governance power belong to Myriad Ranks, not to &quot;cosmic will&quot;; the collective ascension axiom requires the cosmos&#39; evolutionary direction be jointly pushed by Myriad Ranks; the causal self-discipline axiom requires causal threads&#39; running be a law&#39;s natural result, not &quot;the cosmos&#39; arrangement&quot;; the law-first axiom is this entry&#39;s entire content&#39;s meta-rule.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><p>This article focuses: why the transcended one must understand cosmic will in a depersonified way, and how this understanding changes his working style.</p><h2 id="i-personified-cosmic-will-s-three-historical-harms" tabindex="-1">I. Personified Cosmic Will&#39;s Three Historical Harms <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-personified-cosmic-will-s-three-historical-harms" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Personified Cosmic Will&#39;s Three Historical Harms&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Personified &quot;cosmic will&quot; in the old system caused three historical harms:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Harm</th><th>Manifestation</th><th>Consequence</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Harm 1: impersonating will</td><td>Strong ones claim &quot;I represent cosmic will,&quot; endorsing their predatory behavior</td><td>Predation is packaged as &quot;heaven&#39;s will&quot;; resisting predation becomes &quot;defying heaven&quot;</td></tr><tr><td>Harm 2: will hijacking</td><td>When plot needs it, &quot;cosmic will&quot; suddenly sends calamities, grants opportunities</td><td>Myriad Ranks&#39; fate is randomly manipulated; civilization has no autonomy</td></tr><tr><td>Harm 3: personification corruption</td><td>If the cosmos truly has personality, its personality will corrupt — favoring some races, partial to some strong ones</td><td>The cosmos itself becomes the biggest predator and corruptor</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Three harms&#39; common root: <strong>once the cosmos is understood as a personified subject, it gives ambitious people the chance to impersonate it, gives plot an excuse for random manipulation, gives &quot;heaven&#39;s will is justice&quot; predation logic a breeding ground.</strong></p><h2 id="ii-depersonified-understanding-the-cosmos-is-the-law-network-s-natural-running" tabindex="-1">II. Depersonified Understanding: The Cosmos Is the Law Network&#39;s Natural Running <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-depersonified-understanding-the-cosmos-is-the-law-network-s-natural-running" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Depersonified Understanding: The Cosmos Is the Law Network&#39;s Natural Running&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s orthodox understanding of &quot;cosmic will&quot; is: <strong>the so-called &quot;cosmic will&quot; is not some conscious subject making decisions, but the law network&#39;s natural running trend at the macro level.</strong> Concretely:</p><ul><li><strong>The cosmos has no preference</strong>: laws treat all beings equally — energy conservation does not stop constraining you because you are the protagonist; the republican axiom of Myriad Races does not stop applying because you are the villain.</li><li><strong>The cosmos has no emotion</strong>: the cosmos does not &quot;rage,&quot; does not &quot;rejoice,&quot; does not &quot;disappoint.&quot; Cataclysms are not the cosmos&#39; punishment; opportunities are not the cosmos&#39; gifts — they are the law&#39;s running natural results.</li><li><strong>The cosmos has no intention</strong>: the cosmos does not arrange anyone&#39;s fate. A cultivator&#39;s fate is jointly determined by his own choices + the laws&#39; natural running, not &quot;a script the cosmos wrote.&quot;</li></ul><p>This understanding demotes the cosmos from &quot;personified sovereign&quot; to &quot;depersonified law system.&quot; It is cold, but it is just — because it is impartial.</p><h2 id="iii-depersonified-understanding-s-change-to-the-transcended-one-s-working-style" tabindex="-1">III. Depersonified Understanding&#39;s Change to the Transcended One&#39;s Working Style <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-depersonified-understanding-s-change-to-the-transcended-one-s-working-style" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Depersonified Understanding&#39;s Change to the Transcended One&#39;s Working Style&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The transcended one understanding cosmic will in a depersonified way, his working style undergoes three fundamental changes:</p><ol><li><strong>Do not impersonate the cosmos</strong>: the transcended one never says &quot;I represent cosmic will.&quot; What he says is &quot;per the law-first axiom, this serves Myriad Ranks&#39; interests.&quot; His authority does not come from &quot;I am the cosmos&#39; spokesperson,&quot; but from &quot;my operation is within the law framework and approved by Myriad Ranks.&quot;</li><li><strong>Do not wait for heaven&#39;s will</strong>: the transcended one does not expect &quot;the cosmos will solve the problem itself.&quot; The cosmos is a law system; it does not proactively do things — all maintenance, calibration, and repair require the transcended one and Myriad Ranks to proactively do. Heaven will not help you; you must help heaven yourself.</li><li><strong>Do not interpret divine will</strong>: when a cataclysm or opportunity occurs, the transcended one does not interpret from &quot;the cosmos&#39; intention&quot; angle — he analyzes from &quot;the law network&#39;s natural running&quot; angle: which law-parameter drift caused this cataclysm? Which energy-cycle optimization brought this opportunity? Once analyzed clearly, prescribe the right medicine.</li></ol><p>Three changes together: <strong>the transcended one&#39;s relationship to the cosmos is engineer-to-machine — he does not worship the machine, does not beg the machine, does not interpret the machine&#39;s &quot;mood&quot;; he understands the machine&#39;s running laws, then maintains and optimizes it.</strong></p><h2 id="iv-depersonified-understanding-and-myriad-rank-republicanism-s-unity" tabindex="-1">IV. Depersonified Understanding and Myriad-Rank Republicanism&#39;s Unity <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-depersonified-understanding-and-myriad-rank-republicanism-s-unity" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Depersonified Understanding and Myriad-Rank Republicanism&#39;s Unity&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Some feel: understanding the cosmos as a depersonified law system will it make the cosmos &quot;cold&quot; and leave Myriad Ranks without belonging? Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s answer: <strong>depersonified ≠ cold; it equals just.</strong></p><ul><li>Precisely because the cosmos has no personality, it does not play favorites — laws treat all Myriad-Rank life forms equally; this is true &quot;Myriad-Rank republicanism&quot; at the cosmic level&#39;s guarantee.</li><li>Precisely because the cosmos has no intention, Myriad Ranks truly own fate autonomy — the cosmos does not arrange your fate; you and Myriad Ranks jointly decide your own fate.</li><li>Precisely because the cosmos has no emotion, the causal law is truly reliable — causality does not change because of &quot;the cosmos&#39; mood&quot;; whatever cause you plant you get whatever effect, fair and predictable.</li></ul><p>A depersonified cosmos is warmer than a personified cosmos — because its warmth does not come from &quot;god&#39;s favor,&quot; but from &quot;laws&#39; justice.&quot;</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><p><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: not waiting for heaven&#39;s will means all maintenance is proactively executed, not wasting time on &quot;waiting for the cosmos to get better itself&quot;</p></li><li><p><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: not impersonating cosmic will institutionally seals the logic of &quot;I represent heaven&#39;s will so predation is reasonable&quot;</p></li><li><p><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo protagonists are favored by &quot;cosmic will,&quot; with built-in protagonist aura; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s transcended ones do not impersonate heaven&#39;s will, do not wait for favor, all achievements rely on proactive work within the law framework</p></li><li><p><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the depersonified cosmos treats all Myriad-Rank life forms equally; there is no question of &quot;which race the cosmos favors&quot;</p></li><li><p><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: cosmic will&#39;s depersonified understanding, three historical harms, and three working changes are all publicly queryable; Myriad Ranks may supervise whether the transcended one obeys</p></li><li><p>Terminology alignment: the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm is this batch&#39;s standard realm appellation; the transcended one&#39;s civilizational weight dynamically adjusts with post performance; Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision monitors operation compliance throughout; the Myriad-Origin two-way cycle ensures energy and knowledge circulate perpetually among Myriad Ranks; exercise of law-anchor authority is strictly constrained by four-dimensional assessment and democratic procedure.</p></li><li><p><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</p></li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The depersonified understanding of cosmic will is the law-first axiom&#39;s hard-core fulfillment at cosmic-philosophy level. The cosmos has no personality, the cosmos only has laws; the cosmos has no preference, the cosmos only has patterns; the cosmos has no intention, the cosmos only has running. The transcended one understanding the cosmos in this way, he does not impersonate heaven&#39;s will, does not wait for divine grace, does not interpret divine will — what he does is the law engineer&#39;s work: understand patterns, maintain the system, optimize running. When the transcended one and Myriad Ranks both understand the cosmos in a depersonified way, the cosmos is no longer some big shot&#39;s back garden, but the law system Myriad Ranks jointly run. This system does not favor anyone, but it is just to all — this is Myriad-Rank republicanism at the cosmic level&#39;s ultimate guarantee.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/00-衡元宙宇宙总览.html">Entry 00 · Heng Yuan Zhou Cosmos Overview</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/09-现实为基根本立场.html">Entry 09 · Reality-as-Base Fundamental Stance</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/21-共生网络运作原理.html">Entry 21 · Symbiotic-Network Operating Principles</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/821_模块4-超脱者与宇宙-总论.html">Entry 821 · Transcended Ones and the Cosmos Overview</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',29)])])}const p=o(s,[["render",a]]);export{m as __pageData,p as default};
